    "TurboFan represents the apex of V8 engineering. Inside TurboFan, the Sea of Nodes representation combines data flow and control flow into a unified directed graph. This allows the compiler to perform aggressive optimizations: loop invariant code motion (hoisting computations outside of tight loops), dead code elimination (stripping unreachable code branches), and function inlining (replacing function call overhead with the direct body of the callee). When TurboFan inlines a small helper function, it eliminates the CPU cost of allocating a stack frame, passing parameters, and executing return jumps. By maintaining monomorphic function signatures, your enterprise Node.js microservices allow TurboFan to generate machine code that rivals hand-optimized C++."
